<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Authored OSM input for the committed way-alert fixture (T-0319A).

  The fixture bbox around Ivano-Frankove has two real fords but no mapped
  railway crossing, tunnel or hazard, so the committed component cannot come
  from the Ukraine extract and still carry the features the reader and plugin
  tests name. This small extract is the fixture's own OSM input: the real
  `osm-extract` way-alert stage reads it, and the committed
  `way-alerts.geojson` is its output. The Lviv component comes from the real
  Ukraine PBF; see tools/pipeline/README.md.

  Convert to PBF with:
    osmium cat way-alerts.osm -o way-alerts.osm.pbf
-->
